message: "If you use this software or data layout, please cite the manuscript below."
type: software
title: "Latent-space phenotyping of the Phaseolus vulgaris × Boeremia interaction with frozen DINOv2 representations"
abstract: "Reproducible pipeline (Python + R + Quarto) that builds a multidimensional phenotypic landscape of the common-bean × Boeremia interaction from frozen DINOv2 ViT-B/14 embeddings, and benchmarks it against conventional phytopathometry (palette severity, disease-progress curves, AUDPC)."
